From: SkiffOS <skiffos@skiffos.com>
Date: Sun, 04 May 2026 19:45:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] drivers: core: root: sun5i MBUS settle between dm_init and dm_scan (main U-Boot only)

Excluded from SPL: SPL NAND reads use DMA which needs cache coherency.

Signed-off-by: SkiffOS <skiffos@skiffos.com>
---
--- a/drivers/core/root.c	2026-05-08 19:35:42.865896290 +0200
+++ b/drivers/core/root.c	2026-05-08 19:35:42.865896290 +0200
@@ -349,6 +349,17 @@
 		debug("dm_init() failed: %d\n", ret);
 		return ret;
 	}
+#if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_MACH_SUN5I) && !IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_SPL_BUILD)
+	{
+		unsigned int _cnt;
+		asm volatile(
+			"mcr p15, 0, %0, c7, c10, 4\n"
+			"mov %0, #0x200000\n"
+			"1: subs %0, %0, #1\n"
+			"   bne 1b\n"
+			: "=r" (_cnt) :: "cc", "memory");
+	}
+#endif
 	if (!CONFIG_IS_ENABLED(OF_PLATDATA_INST)) {
 		ret = dm_scan(pre_reloc_only);
 		if (ret) {
